1
00:00:00,501 --> 00:00:02,541
(Penny:)I said no. Put it down.

2
00:00:05,089 --> 00:00:07,089
[KEYS JINGLING]

3
00:00:08,133 --> 00:00:10,223
(Penny:)Hey, Sheldon.

4
00:00:10,636 --> 00:00:12,466
(Sheldon(unlocking his mailbox):)Hello, Penny.

5
00:00:13,222 --> 00:00:15,302
(Penny:)Get anything good?

6
00:00:16,809 --> 00:00:19,899
(Sheldon:)Just the latest copy
of Applied Particle Physics Quarterly.

7
00:00:20,312 --> 00:00:24,402
(Penny:)Oh, you know, that is so weird
that yours came and mine didn't.

8
00:00:29,363 --> 00:00:30,443
(Penny:)It was a joke.

9
00:00:31,824 --> 00:00:33,114
Heh-heh.

10
00:00:35,244 --> 00:00:39,294
(Penny:)Yup. Tip your waitresses.
I'm here all week.

11
00:00:40,708 --> 00:00:42,538
(Sheldon:)To save you from further awkwardness...

12
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:46,500
...know that I'm comfortable with
the two of us climbing the stairs in silence.

13
00:00:46,672 --> 00:00:48,962
Oh, yeah, okay, me too. Zip it, lock it.

14
00:00:51,969 --> 00:00:53,759
(Penny:)Put it in your pocket.

15
00:00:57,683 --> 00:01:00,563
(Penny:)- So you and Leonard...
- Oh, dear God.

